{
  "name": "AI Client Concierge System",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "description": "AI-powered intake system that handles client lead qualification, scheduling, status updates, and FAQ responses. Automatically processes inbound inquiries via GPT-4o analysis, routes qualified leads to scheduling and CRM logging, sends polite declines with recommendations for non-qualified leads, and runs recurring follow-up checks on active leads.",
  "flow": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "module": "webhook:receive",
      "version": 2,
      "metadata": {
        "designer": {
          "x": 100,
          "y": 200
        },
        "parameters": {
          "webhook": {
            "webhookId": "ai-concierge-inbound-v1"
          }
        }
      },
      "parameters": {},
      "mapper": {
        "data": {
          "name": "{{1.name}}",
          "email": "{{1.email}}",
          "company": "{{1.company}}",
          "service_interest": "{{1.service_interest}}",
          "budget": "{{1.budget}}",
          "message": "{{1.message}}",
          "phone": "{{1.phone}}",
          "referral_source": "{{1.referral_source}}",
          "timeline": "{{1.timeline}}",
          "heard_about": "{{1.heard_about}}",
          "timestamp": "{{timestamp}}"
        }
      },
      "moduleModel": {
        "type": "webhook",
        "nativeType": "webhook",
        "label": "Inbound Inquiry Webhook",
        "notes": "Receives client inquiry data from website form, landing page, or API POST. Expected fields: name, email, company, service_interest, budget, message, phone, referral_source, timeline, heard_about."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "module": "http:request",
      "version": 2,
      "metadata": {
        "designer": {
          "x": 280,
          "y": 200
        },
        "parameters": {
          "url": "https://api.openai.com/v1/chat/completions",
          "method": "POST",
          "headers": {
            "Authorization": "Bearer {{3.apiKey}}",
            "Content-Type": "application/json"
          },
          "body": {
            "model": "gpt-4o",
            "messages": [
              {
                "role": "system",
                "content": "You are an expert AI client concierge for a digital agency. Your job is to analyze incoming client inquiries and:\n\n1. EXTRACT INTENT: Determine the primary intent of the inquiry (new project inquiry, existing client status update, general question/FAQ, partnership request, or support issue).\n\n2. QUALIFY THE LEAD: Evaluate if this is a serious, qualified lead based on:\n   - Does the inquiry mention a specific project or need?\n   - Is there a budget range or willingness to invest?\n   - Is the contact information complete (name, email, company)?\n   - Does the timeline indicate urgency or genuine interest?\n   - Is the inquiry professional and coherent?\n\n   A qualified lead should have at least 3 of 5 positive signals.\n\n3. DETERMINE BEST SERVICE FIT: Map the inquiry to one of these services:\n   - Web Development (websites, web apps, e-commerce)\n   - Mobile Development (iOS, Android, cross-platform)\n   - AI & Automation (chatbots, AI agents, workflow automation)\n   - UI/UX Design (design systems, prototypes, UX research)\n   - Consulting (strategy, tech advisory)\n   - Other (specify)\n\n4. WRITE A PERSONALIZED RESPONSE: Draft a warm, professional email response body (plain text) that:\n   - Thanks the prospect for their inquiry\n   - Shows understanding of their specific needs\n   - Briefly introduces relevant expertise\n   - Proposes next steps (discovery call for qualified, alternative resources for unqualified)\n   - Is under 200 words\n\n5. SUGGEST MEETING TOPICS: If qualified, suggest 2-3 talking points for the discovery call.\n\nRespond in the following JSON format ONLY (no markdown, no code fences):\n{\n  \"intent\": \"new_project_inquiry | status_update | general_question | partnership | support\",\n  \"qualified\": true | false,\n  \"qualification_score\": 0-5,\n  \"qualification_signals\": [\"signal1\", \"signal2\", ...],\n  \"best_service_fit\": \"Web Development | Mobile Development | AI & Automation | UI/UX Design | Consulting | Other\",\n  \"service_explanation\": \"Brief explanation of why this service fits\",\n  \"confidence\": 0.0-1.0,\n  \"personalized_response\": \"Full email response body here...\",\n  \"suggested_meeting_topics\": [\"Topic 1\", \"Topic 2\", \"Topic 3\"],\n  \"faq_answer\": \"If intent is general_question, provide helpful answer here\",\n  \"budget_assessment\": \"low | medium | high | premium | unclear\",\n  \"urgency\": \"low | medium | high | urgent\",\n  \"extracted_company_name\": \"Company name if mentioned\",\n  \"extracted_project_name\": \"Project name if mentioned\"\n}",
                "role": "user",
                "content": "Analyze this client inquiry for our agency:\n\nName: {{1.name}}\nEmail: {{1.email}}\nCompany: {{1.company}}\nService Interest: {{1.service_interest}}\nBudget: {{1.budget}}\nTimeline: {{1.timeline}}\nMessage: {{1.message}}\nReferral Source: {{1.referral_source}}\nHeard About Us: {{1.heard_about}}"
              }
            ],
            "temperature": 0.3,
            "max_tokens": 1500,
            "response_format": {
              "type": "json_object"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "parameters": {
        "url": "https://api.openai.com/v1/chat/completions",
        "method": "POST",
        "headers": {
          "Authorization": "Bearer {{3.apiKey}}",
          "Content-Type": "application/json"
        },
        "bodyType": "json",
        "parseResponse": "json",
        "followRedirects": true,
        "timeout": 60000,
        "enableAdvancedJsonParsing": true
      },
      "mapper": {
        "url": "https://api.openai.com/v1/chat/completions",
        "method": "POST",
        "headers": {
          "Authorization": "Bearer {{3.apiKey}}",
          "Content-Type": "application/json"
        },
        "bodyType": "json",
        "parseResponse": "json",
        "followRedirects": true,
        "timeout": 60000,
        "enableAdvancedJsonParsing": true
      },
      "moduleModel": {
        "type": "http",
        "nativeType": "http",
        "label": "GPT-4o Inquiry Analysis",
        "notes": "Calls OpenAI GPT-4o to analyze inquiry, extract intent, qualify lead, determine service fit, and draft personalized response."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "module": "router:router",
      "version": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "designer": {
          "x": 460,
          "y": 200
        },
        "parameters": {}
      },
      "parameters": {},
      "mapper": {},
      "routes": [
        {
          "id": "route_a_qualified",
          "label": "Qualified Lead",
          "conditions": {
            "type": "if",
            "operator": "eq",
            "firstValue": "{{2.data.qualified}}",
            "secondValue": true
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "route_b_not_qualified",
          "label": "Not Qualified",
          "conditions": {
            "type": "else"
          }
        }
      ],
      "moduleModel": {
        "type": "router",
        "nativeType": "flowControl",
        "label": "Qualification Router",
        "notes": "Splits workflow based on GPT-4o qualification result. Path A = qualified lead, Path B = not qualified."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "module": "googleCalendar:createEvent",
      "version": 3,
      "metadata": {
        "designer": {
          "x": 640,
          "y": 100
        },
        "parameters": {
          "connection": "{{4.connection}}"
        }
      },
      "parameters": {
        "connection": "{{4.connection}}"
      },
      "mapper": {
        "calendarId": "primary",
        "summary": "Discovery Call: {{1.name}} — {{2.data.extracted_company_name}}",
        "description": "Discovery Call with {{1.name}} ({{1.email}})\n\nCompany: {{1.company}}\nService Interest: {{1.service_interest}}\nBudget: {{1.budget}}\nTimeline: {{1.timeline}}\n\n--- AI Analysis ---\nIntent: {{2.data.intent}}\nQualification Score: {{2.data.qualification_score}}/5\nBest Service Fit: {{2.data.best_service_fit}}\n\n--- Suggested Talking Points ---\n{{2.data.suggested_meeting_topics[0]}}\n{{2.data.suggested_meeting_topics[1]}}\n{{2.data.suggested_meeting_topics[2]}}\n\n--- Original Inquiry ---\n{{1.message}}\n\n--- Setup Notes ---\nThis meeting was automatically scheduled by the AI Client Concierge System.\nPlease review the lead in your CRM before the call.",
        "startDate": "{{addDays(now, 2)}}",
        "startTime": "10:00",
        "endDate": "{{addDays(now, 2)}}",
        "endTime": "10:30",
        "timezone": "America/New_York",
        "attendees": [
          {
            "email": "{{1.email}}",
            "displayName": "{{1.name}}"
          },
          {
            "email": "team@agency.com",
            "displayName": "Agency Team"
          }
        ],
        "reminders": {
          "useDefault": false,
          "overrides": [
            {
              "method": "email",
              "minutes": 60
            },
            {
              "method": "popup",
              "minutes": 30
            },
            {
              "method": "popup",
              "minutes": 10
            }
          ]
        },
        "conferenceData": {
          "createRequest": {
            "requestId": "{{uuid}}",
            "conferenceSolutionKey": {
              "type": "hangoutsMeet"
            }
          }
        },
        "colorId": "7",
        "visibility": "default",
        "status": "confirmed"
      },
      "moduleModel": {
        "type": "googleCalendar",
        "nativeType": "googleCalendar",
        "label": "Create Discovery Call (Google Calendar)",
        "notes": "Creates a 30-minute Google Calendar event with Google Meet link, 2 business days out. Includes attendee from prospect and internal team."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "module": "gmail:sendEmail",
      "version": 2,
      "metadata": {
        "designer": {
          "x": 820,
          "y": 100
        },
        "parameters": {
          "connection": "{{5.connection}}"
        }
      },
      "parameters": {
        "connection": "{{5.connection}}"
      },
      "mapper": {
        "to": "{{1.email}}",
        "cc": "team@agency.com",
        "bcc": "",
        "subject": "Welcome! Your Discovery Call is Confirmed — {{1.name}}",
        "bodyType": "html",
        "body": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <style>\n    body { font-family: 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; margin: 0; padding: 0; background-color: #f4f6f8; }\n    .container { max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; background: #ffffff; border-radius: 12px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); }\n    .header { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%); padding: 40px 30px; text-align: center; }\n    .header h1 { color: #ffffff; margin: 0; font-size: 28px; font-weight: 700; }\n    .header p { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.9); margin: 8px 0 0 0; font-size: 16px; }\n    .content { padding: 30px; }\n    .greeting { font-size: 18px; color: #2d3748; margin-bottom: 20px; }\n    .greeting strong { color: #667eea; }\n    .details-box { background: #f7fafc; border-left: 4px solid #667eea; padding: 20px; margin: 20px 0; border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0; }\n    .details-box h3 { margin: 0 0 12px 0; color: #2d3748; font-size: 16px; }\n    .details-box p { margin: 6px 0; color: #4a5568; font-size: 14px; }\n    .details-box .label { font-weight: 600; color: #2d3748; }\n    .button-container { text-align: center; margin: 30px 0; }\n    .button { display: inline-block; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%); color: #ffffff; text-decoration: none; padding: 14px 36px; border-radius: 8px; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(102, 126, 234, 0.4); }\n    .button:hover { box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(102, 126, 234, 0.6); }\n    .info-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 16px; margin: 20px 0; }\n    .info-item { background: #f7fafc; padding: 16px; border-radius: 8px; }\n    .info-item .label { font-size: 12px; color: #a0aec0; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px; font-weight: 600; }\n    .info-item .value { font-size: 15px; color: #2d3748; margin-top: 4px; font-weight: 500; }\n    .message-box { background: #ebf4ff; padding: 20px; border-radius: 8px; margin: 20px 0; }\n    .message-box p { margin: 0; color: #2b6cb0; font-style: italic; font-size: 14px; }\n    .footer { padding: 20px 30px; background: #f7fafc; text-align: center; border-top: 1px solid #e2e8f0; }\n    .footer p { margin: 4px 0; color: #a0aec0; font-size: 12px; }\n    .footer a { color: #667eea; text-decoration: none; }\n    hr { border: none; border-top: 1px solid #e2e8f0; margin: 24px 0; }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <div class=\"container\">\n    <div class=\"header\">\n      <h1>You're On Our Calendar! 🎉</h1>\n      <p>Your Discovery Call has been scheduled</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"content\">\n      <p class=\"greeting\">Hi <strong>{{1.name}}</strong>,</p>\n      <p style=\"color: #4a5568; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7;\">\n        Thank you for reaching out to us at <strong>Agency</strong>! We're excited to learn more about {{1.company}} \n        and discuss how we can help with <strong>{{1.service_interest}}</strong>.\n      </p>\n\n      <div class=\"details-box\">\n        <h3>📅 Your Discovery Call Details</h3>\n        <p><span class=\"label\">Date:</span> {{formatDate(addDays(now, 2), \"dddd, MMMM Do, YYYY\")}}</p>\n        <p><span class=\"label\">Time:</span> 10:00 AM — 10:30 AM (Eastern Time)</p>\n        <p><span class=\"label\">Duration:</span> 30 minutes</p>\n        <p><span class=\"label\">With:</span> Your Agency Team</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"button-container\">\n        <a href=\"{{4.conferenceData.entryPoints[0].uri}}\" class=\"button\" target=\"_blank\">🔗 Join Google Meet</a>\n      </div>\n\n      <p style=\"color: #4a5568; font-size: 14px; text-align: center;\">\n        A calendar invitation has been sent to your email with the meeting link.\n      </p>\n\n      <div class=\"info-grid\">\n        <div class=\"info-item\">\n          <div class=\"label\">Service Interest</div>\n          <div class=\"value\">{{1.service_interest}}</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"info-item\">\n          <div class=\"label\">Budget Range</div>\n          <div class=\"value\">{{1.budget}}</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"info-item\">\n          <div class=\"label\">Company</div>\n          <div class=\"value\">{{1.company}}</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"info-item\">\n          <div class=\"label\">Timeline</div>\n          <div class=\"value\">{{1.timeline}}</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <hr>\n\n      <div class=\"message-box\">\n        <p>\"{{2.data.personalized_response}}\"</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <h3 style=\"color: #2d3748; font-size: 16px; margin-top: 24px;\">💡 What to Expect on the Call</h3>\n      <ul style=\"color: #4a5568; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.8; padding-left: 20px;\">\n        <li>We'll dive deeper into your project goals and requirements</li>\n        <li>We'll share relevant case studies and examples from similar work</li>\n        <li>We'll outline a proposed approach and timeline</li>\n        <li>You'll have plenty of time to ask questions</li>\n      </ul>\n\n      <h3 style=\"color: #2d3748; font-size: 16px; margin-top: 24px;\">📋 In the Meantime</h3>\n      <ul style=\"color: #4a5568; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.8; padding-left: 20px;\">\n        <li>Check out our <a href=\"https://agency.com/portfolio\" style=\"color: #667eea;\">portfolio</a> for relevant work samples</li>\n        <li>Review our <a href=\"https://agency.com/process\" style=\"color: #667eea;\">engagement process</a> to understand how we work</li>\n        <li>Feel free to reply to this email with any questions before the call</li>\n      </ul>\n\n      <p style=\"color: #4a5568; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-top: 24px;\">\n        We're looking forward to speaking with you!\n      </p>\n      <p style=\"color: #2d3748; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7;\">\n        Best regards,<br>\n        <strong>The Agency Team</strong><br>\n        <span style=\"color: #667eea; font-size: 13px;\">hello@agency.com | (555) 123-4567</span>\n      </p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"footer\">\n      <p>© {{formatDate(now, \"YYYY\")}} Agency. All rights reserved.</p>\n      <p>123 Business Ave, Suite 100, New York, NY 10001</p>\n      <p>\n        <a href=\"https://agency.com/privacy\">Privacy Policy</a> ·\n        <a href=\"https://agency.com/terms\">Terms of Service</a> ·\n        <a href=\"mailto:hello@agency.com\">Contact Us</a>\n      </p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</body>\n</html>",
        "fromName": "Agency Concierge Team",
        "replyTo": "hello@agency.com",
        "attachments": []
      },
      "moduleModel": {
        "type": "gmail",
        "nativeType": "gmail",
        "label": "Send Confirmation Email (Qualified)",
        "notes": "Sends a branded HTML welcome email to the prospect with calendar link, call details, service info, and next steps."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "module": "googleSheets:addRow",
      "version": 3,
      "metadata": {
        "designer": {
          "x": 820,
          "y": 200
        },
        "parameters": {
          "connection": "{{6.connection}}"
        }
      },
      "parameters": {
        "connection": "{{6.connection}}"
      },
      "mapper": {
        "spreadsheetId": "YOUR_SPREADSHEET_ID_HERE",
        "sheetName": "Qualified Leads",
        "headersRowNumber": "1",
        "values": {
          "0": "{{timestamp}}",
          "1": "{{1.name}}",
          "2": "{{1.email}}",
          "3": "{{1.company}}",
          "4": "{{1.phone}}",
          "5": "{{1.service_interest}}",
          "6": "{{2.data.best_service_fit}}",
          "7": "{{1.budget}}",
          "8": "{{2.data.budget_assessment}}",
          "9": "{{1.timeline}}",
          "10": "{{2.data.urgency}}",
          "11": "{{1.message}}",
          "12": "{{2.data.intent}}",
          "13": "{{2.data.qualification_score}}",
          "14": "Qualified",
          "15": "{{formatDate(addDays(now, 2), \"YYYY-MM-DD\")}}",
          "16": "10:00 AM ET",
          "17": "Discovery Call Scheduled",
          "18": "{{2.data.suggested_meeting_topics[0]}} | {{2.data.suggested_meeting_topics[1]}} | {{2.data.suggested_meeting_topics[2]}}",
          "19": "{{1.referral_source}}",
          "20": "{{1.heard_about}}",
          "21": "{{2.data.service_explanation}}"
        }
      },
      "moduleModel": {
        "type": "googleSheets",
        "nativeType": "googleSheets",
        "label": "Log Qualified Lead to Sheet",
        "notes": "Adds a new row to the 'Qualified Leads' sheet with full lead details, AI analysis, and scheduled call info. Column headers: Timestamp, Name, Email, Company, Phone, Service Interest, Best Service Fit, Budget, Budget Assessment, Timeline, Urgency, Message, Intent, Qualification Score, Status, Call Date, Call Time, Call Stage, Talking Points, Referral Source, Heard About, Service Explanation."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "module": "slack:sendMessage",
      "version": 2,
      "metadata": {
        "designer": {
          "x": 820,
          "y": 300
        },
        "parameters": {
          "connection": "{{7.connection}}"
        }
      },
      "parameters": {
        "connection": "{{7.connection}}"
      },
      "mapper": {
        "channel": "#lead-alerts",
        "text": "🚀 New Qualified Lead: {{1.name}} from {{1.company}}",
        "parse": "full",
        "linkNames": true,
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "header",
            "text": {
              "type": "plain_text",
              "text": "🚀 New Qualified Lead — Action Required",
              "emoji": true
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "section",
            "fields": [
              {
                "type": "mrkdwn",
                "text": "*Name:*\n{{1.name}}"
              },
              {
                "type": "mrkdwn",
                "text": "*Company:*\n{{1.company}}"
              },
              {
                "type": "mrkdwn",
                "text": "*Email:*\n<mailto:{{1.email}}|{{1.email}}>"
              },
              {
                "type": "mrkdwn",
                "text": "*Phone:*\n{{1.phone}}"
              },
              {
                "type": "mrkdwn",
                "text": "*Service Interest:*\n{{1.service_interest}}"
              },
              {
                "type": "mrkdwn",
                "text": "*Best Fit:*\n{{2.data.best_service_fit}}"
              },
              {
                "type": "mrkdwn",
